      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SHOW ON THE ROAD (1) did nothing fresh up in a stronger field, and clearly needed the run. He will strip fitter, and also has the winkers on for the first time to keep him interested early on. Brad Parnham is back in the saddle, and from the pole position, he can have a say in the finish. COME ON EMMA (2) stuck to his task well when fighting on bravely for third fresh up at Pinjarra just over 3 weeks ago. She has found it hard to win another race, but does look well placed for her first run on this track. Each way. PLAYING FREE (4) was back in form with a bold effort for second in his first run here 10 days ago over 1300m. His only win came over this trip, and he can go one better. VALANNE DAWN (5) had a case of cardiac arrhythmia last time out, and was given the all clear at a trial since then. She benefits from a 3kg claim, and a form reversal is possible with a drop back to 1400m. VARAZZE (7) has not done much since arriving from NSW, but the step up to 1400m may help her.",
